  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DANEP monitoring og kommunikation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Monitoring &amp; Evaluation consultancy is to ensure proper monitoring and reporting of the entire DANEP programme at its programmatic level, across the two countries and each of the development engagements and target interventions.

The M&amp;E consultants will assist Department for European Neighbourhood (EUN) with:

(a)	An overview of overall progress of the DANEP programme against the DANEP objectives and thematic theories of change in the programme.
(b)	A detailed assessment of progress of individual development engagements under DANEP based on the DANEP partners&#x2019; reporting and field mission assessments.

The objective of the Communication Consultancy is to ensure timely and relevant communication and public diplomacy of the entire DANEP programme using a multi-pronged approach at programmatic level, across the two countries and for each of the development engagements and target interventions as well as to provide inputs to policy dialogue and other relevant monitoring, evaluation and reporting processes.</narrative>
  </description>
